			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Finalize Vine gRPC type forwarding and delegate remaining notification atoms\n\nComplete the extraction of Mountain's gRPC infrastructure into the `Vine` library crate. Replace the local generated code in `Source/Vine/Generated/mod.rs` with type aliases that forward all protobuf message types and service clients/servers to `::Vine::Generated::*`, ensuring the workspace uses a single canonical type definition.\n\nDelegate the remaining notification handler implementations to their Vine counterparts: `UpdateScmGroup`, `WebviewLifecycle`, and `RelayToSky` become thin pass-throughs. Consolidate provider unregistration by routing the simple variants directly to `::Vine::Server::Notification::Support::UnregisterByHandle` from the dispatcher, keeping only the complex cases (file system, SCM, URI handler) as separate modules.\n\nMove the SCM marker persistence logic from `UpdateScmGroup.rs` into `VineHostImpl::UpdateScmGroupMarkers`, decoupling the notification atom from Mountain-specific application state.\n\nThis removes the final locally-implemented gRPC handlers, reducing Mountain to a composition layer that delegates all Cocoon→Mountain IPC to the shared Vine crate.",
